    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, when you cast a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point per increased level to make spell deflection, @Compendium[wands.spells-wands.SQnurPdikw1UbJ3p]{Finite Incantatem}, or @Compendium[wands.spells-wands.F65nsK2xlfBqNOhH]{Reparifors}  as if your spell was cast using a spell slot higher than its original level, making your spell more resistant. The spell's higher level cannot exceed your highest available level of spell slots. This does not count against your number of Metamagic options.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Foundry Note: Once adding this to a sheet, you will need to tell it what resource to consume when used.</p>\n<p>When casting Resistant Spell with an increased spell level, you will have to manually input the number of Sorcery Points consumed.</p>",
